a plant for your desk, coffee for your coworker, a massage for yourself... really, whatever</li> </ul> </li> <li>Open concept office with friendly coworkers</li> <li>Creative environment where you can make a difference</li> <li>No dumb benefits like free dog walking on the weekends that snobby hipster places have to make you feel cool, but mathematically won't cost the company much money because you won't use it</li> <li>Trail Mix Bar - oh yeah</li> </ul> <br><b>Responsibilities</b><br><ul><li>Create compelling ad copy working with our marketing teams to make it pop</li><li>Use data, tools, and your noggin to identify target audiences</li><li>Set up, manage, and monitor ad campaigns</li><li>Stay up to date on current trends and practices</li></ul> <br><b>Requirements</b><br><ul><li>Bachelor's degree in Marketing, Communications, Business, a related field, or equivalent professional experience</li><li>2+ years in an Ad Buying capacity</li><li>Proficiency with Facebook Ads Manager and analytics tools</li><li>Ability to interpret data to make strategic decisions</li><li>Experience with other platforms (ex. Google Ads)</li></ul> <br>Back to Jobs <br><b>Ad Buyer - Facebook</b><br>Remote | Post Falls, ID | Spokane, WA | Salt Lake City, UT | Austin, TX <br>Apply Now <br><b>Why Work Here</b><br>Do you find yourself looking forward to all the different billboards on your drives? And then think to yourself, \"Why is there an ad for farm equipment in the middle of the city??\". It drives you crazy until you find out why someone would do this. You know there is a reason, and you've got to think, they know something I don't know. We want to be that person.","directApply":false,"jobLocationType":"TELECOMMUTE","identifier":{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Corporate Tools LLC","value":"7166737"},"baseSalary":{"@type":"MonetaryAmount","currency":"USD","value":{"@type":"QuantitativeValue","minValue":65000,"maxValue":65000,"unitText":"YEAR"}},"datePosted":"2026-08-20","employmentType"