{
  "@context": "http://schema.org/",
  "@type": "JobPosting",
  "title": "Brand Communications Intern",
  "description": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Are you a student looking for an exciting opportunity to learn and excel in PR &amp;amp; social media marketing? Look no further. We’re on the hunt for a social-savvy, creative, and well-organized PR and Social Media Intern to join our Brand Communications team during the fall of 2026!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;As our PR and Social Media Intern, you will support the Brand Comms Team in their daily operations with tasks related to supporting press activities (such as influencer send-outs, stylist requests and media monitoring), content creation and coordination, publishing and community management, as well as other varied administrative tasks relevant to social media, PR and marketing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;The internship is unpaid and the details of your current academic situation are what sets the terms of this internship. We are looking for you who are available for 4-6 months, preferably full-time. We are looking for someone who can join us from August/September 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Requirements &amp;amp; Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;You have ongoing studies in Marketing, Communications, or a related field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;You are a great writer and fluent in English, both written and spoken.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Familiar with the Microsoft Office and Google suite.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;For this position, you need to have a work permit or be a Swedish/EU citizen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience with Content Creation and Adobe suite is a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;This internship must fulfill a curriculum requirement for your degree.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Who you are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;You have a genuine interest in PR, influencers, community building and fashion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;You’re well-organized, sociable, and comfortable working in fast-paced environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;You’re a team player that isn’t afraid to take on a wide range of tasks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;You are a Social Media enthusiast.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Most importantly, you have the personality to fit a somewhat crazy, fun work environment where we believe in color and playfulness, a place where you can expect the unexpected and you are a source of creative weirdness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;We see that you are available to work on-site from our Stockholm headquarters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;We care a lot about diversity at Happy Socks and would love to see a range of genders, ages, and various backgrounds apply. Happy Socks is a multicultural company of around 150 people from over 25 countries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
