{
  "@context": "http://schema.org/",
  "@type": "JobPosting",
  "title": "Senior Account (Solutions) Manager",
  "description": "&lt;figure data-alignment=&quot;left&quot; class=&quot;relative&quot; style=&quot;width:fit-content;margin-left:0px;margin-right:auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://images.teamtailor-cdn.com/images/s3/teamtailor-production/gallery_picture/image_uploads/f04b8e89-5c73-44d1-ac60-47332d64592d/original.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;ah-logo-horizontal-light-rgb.jpg&quot; title=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;238&quot; height=&quot;62.37903225806451&quot; data-alignment=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;width:238px;height:auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Founded in 1996, Atlantis Health is a strategic patient engagement partner for pharma and healthcare organizations. We help clients improve patient experience, outcomes and impact through proven patient engagement solutions grounded in behavioral science. We design and deliver solutions across the health journey, from early insight and strategy to implementation, measurement and optimization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our work addresses key patient challenges such as:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• disease awareness and activation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• treatment access and initiation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• medication adherence and persistence&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• self-management of wider health behaviors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every solution is shaped around what drives patient behavior in each therapy area, treatment context and journey stage. We work closely with clients, patients and healthcare professionals to create engagement that is relevant, practical, compliant and effective in the real world to empower &lt;strong&gt;Change for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To help people Change for Good by empowering them to achieve health goals that will positively impact their lives and the lives of those around them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Atlantis?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;At Atlantis Health we offer a collaborative, supportive and ambitious environment where all ideas are valued. AH are committed to supporting you to reach your goals and develop your career in line with your strengths and ambitions. We are a growing team of friendly, high-performing people, with a passion to deliver meaningful work that makes a difference to patients’ lives!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW151029225 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW151029225 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;A Senior Account Manager at Atlantis Health UK is responsible for building long-term client relationships through exceptional project delivery and acting as the primary day-to-day contact for assigned accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW151029225 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW151029225 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Working closely with our Behavioral Science team, this role focuses on understanding client objectives, stakeholder unmet needs and translating them into patient engagement solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;You will work closely with internal teams and partners including strategy, creative, content and digital to plan and manage effective delivery, ensuring high quality deliverables that are within budget and timelines.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Alongside project delivery, you will act as a trusted advisor, supporting clients proactively and seeking ongoing opportunities to add value, contributing to account growth and client success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW151029225 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Client service delivery&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW256106502 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;• Takes the leadership role in managing the overall project execution (operates as the Single Point of Contact (SPOC) for his/her client projects) i.e. Leads status calls, client presentations, and workshops and responds to project requests&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW256106502 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;• Communicates briefs/requirements, timelines, issues, status, and progress to all project stakeholders (clients, internal AH, and external suppliers involved in projects)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW256106502 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;• Ensures high-quality standards are maintained throughout the project while managing project timelines and ensuring all AH procedures and industry standards are maintained&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW256106502 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;• Proactively identifies and develops solutions for further opportunities and highlights when potential issues may arise&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW256106502 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;• Provides insight and analysis on overall project status and client relationship, including proactively sharing valuable insights and project results within AH&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW256106502 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;• Supports financial management of the project, including opportunity planning, creating budgets, raising POs, reviewing cost estimates (external suppliers), raising invoices, and being accountable for the profitability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW256106502 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;• Is a team player and willing to help out across all functions of work that the agency is delivering and pitching to win&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW256106502 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Client relationship building and business development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109999569 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;• Establishes and maintains strong trust-based relationships with key client stakeholders for individual projects and identifies opportunities to establish new connections across his/her client organisations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109999569 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;• Seeks opportunities to expand Atlantis’ scope of work within existing clients, proactively submitting organic growth proposals, and raising ideas within the Client Service team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject Dr