CX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW83260322 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;&quot;&gt;• Proven ability to effectively manage large projects and client accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW83260322 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;white-space:pre !important;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;in UK / Europe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW83260322 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW83260322 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;&quot;&gt;• Proven ability to lead and deliver a range of deliverables such as patient/HCP-focused materials, client strategic consultancy, patient support programmes and other digital –solutions on time and on budget &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW83260322 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;white-space:pre !important;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW83260322 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;• Sound knowledge of the healthcare industry and the ABPI/EFPIA codes in order to be compliant and credible in front of leading pharmaceutical clients &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW83260322 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;&quot;&gt;• Strong communication capabilities in order to manage both internal and external stakeholders&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW83260322 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;white-space:pre !important;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW83260322 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW83260322 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;&quot;&gt;• Previous line management experience is desirable, however if you do not have line management experience yet but want the opportunity to join us as an Senor Account (Solutions) Manager, please still apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW83260322 BCX8&quot; style=&quot;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:12pt;line-height:20.85px;font-family:Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Our UK &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https://atlantishealth.com/us/contact/united-kingdom/&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;