  "@type": "JobPosting",
  "title": "General Template to start from",
  "description": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Our company is a world class, global organization with a fast-paced dynamic environment that is moving forward with industry 4.0 and introducing new technology. The energized culture encourages personal growth and unique opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1pt none;padding:0in;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;We pride ourselves with having the best people, which are our most important assets. Our company has been recognized for having the highest ethics and strives for excellency through distinctly higher standards than the norm. This position requires an intellectual and sober minded individual who is constantly looking at personal growth, it is mandatory to have the applicable qualifications and experience as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ensures regulatory watch and assesses regulatory compliance in terms of HS&amp;amp;S &amp;amp; sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ensures compliance with applicable HS&amp;amp;S &amp;amp; sustainability regulation, other external and internal requirements and with ALV Corporate standards &amp;amp; AEU Standards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;&quot;&gt;Execute the implementation and maintenance of the AEU HS&amp;amp;S management system in accordance with the ISO 14001 and ISO 45001 standards, to ensure site’s certifications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;&quot;&gt;Execute the implementation and maintenance of the AEU Energy Management System compliant to ISO 50001 requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;&quot;&gt;Manages relations with the plant Manager, employees &amp;amp; unions, and AEU HS&amp;amp;S team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;&quot;&gt;Trains employees at all levels on HS&amp;amp;S, sustainability issues and responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Coordinates the emergency response in case of accident, fire, pollution, natural disaster.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Conducts the necessary audits and inspections to ensure compliance with commitments in terms of sustainable development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;&quot;&gt;Implement AEU standards and implement programs that foster continuous improvement and compliance with the EMS.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;&quot;&gt;Schedules and conducts, Internal site EMS Audits and External EMS Compliance Audits and provides recommendations where needed. Develop critical risk mitigation plans and actions.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;&quot;&gt;Provide advice and technical expertise to site management.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;&quot;&gt;Assist site management in all regulatory interfacing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;&quot;&gt;Provides assistance to site management in collection of environmental data and the tracking of objectives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Review and report site EMS performance regularly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;More lives saved – more life lived!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
