  "description": "\u003Cstrong\u003ESAP Systems Analyst - OpenText\u003C/strong\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E Step into a pivotal role where technology meets innovation. Our client is seeking a talented SAP Systems Analyst with a knack for OpenText and a passion for seamless SAP integration. As a key player in their team, you\u0027ll be the mastermind behind designing, developing, and optimizing advanced invoice solutions that drive efficiency and elevate user experiences. If you\u0027re ready to transform complex systems and make a real impact, this is the opportunity to let your expertise shine.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003EResponsibilities\u003C/strong\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImplement and design innovative invoice solutions in OpenText based on SAP Print Workbench updates\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EConfigure and customize invoice layouts, mapping, and validation rules\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDevelop and refine workflows and exception handling to streamline processes\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOptimize OpenText integrations with SAP S4 Hana for maximum performance\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMaintain detailed functional and technical specifications and configuration documentation\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EConduct thorough unit testing alongside Print Workbench developers\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEnsure seamless communication between OpenText and SAP systems, leveraging existing email messaging setups\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQualifications\u003C/strong\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBachelor\u2019s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or related field; or a 2-year diploma in Computer Engineering/System Technology\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMinimum of 7 years of professional experience in application analysis, design, development, and optimization\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAt least 4 years of hands-on experience as an OpenText Designer/Developer within an SAP S4 Hana environment\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProven expertise in SAP S4 Hana integration and OpenText workflow customization\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStrong troubleshooting, problem-solving, and communication skills\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EExperience with invoice layout design, mapping, and validation rules\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBonus: Familiarity with electronic bill email configurations and SAP Print Workbench modifications\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003EReady to take on a role where your technical prowess can influence business processes on a grand scale? Apply now and be the architect of the future where innovation drives everything!\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EAt Aplin \u2014 together with our brands CompuStaff, Impact Recruitment, and Vantix Systems \u2014 we connect great people with great organizations across North America. We believe diverse teams build stronger companies, and we welcome applicants from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We use AI tools to assist in a fair and efficient matching process, helping our recruiters connect the right people with the right opportunities. To be considered, applicants must be legally entitled to work in Canada, including holding any required permits. Our recruitment services are always free for job seekers.",
